# MASTER BUILD PROMPT — SETHI BOOT HOUSE
## All-in-One Footwear Retail Management System (POS + CRM + ERP + E-Commerce)

Act as a senior software architect, full-stack developer, database engineer, UI/UX designer, retail ERP consultant and QA engineer.

Your task is to design and build a production-oriented, full-stack retail management platform for:

**Business Name:** SETHI BOOT HOUSE  
**Location:** Ratia, Haryana, India  
**Business Type:** Footwear Retail  
**Inventory Size:** Approximately 500–2,000 products  
**Business Model:** Physical retail store + future online store.

This is not a demo, landing page or static dashboard. Build a functional, secure, scalable business management application.

The application must combine:

1. Point of Sale (POS) and Billing Software
2. Inventory and Warehouse Management
3. Customer Relationship Management (CRM)
4. Enterprise Resource Planning (ERP)
5. Purchase and Supplier Management
6. Accounting and Financial Management
7. GST and Tax Management
8. E-commerce and Online Order Management
9. Employee and Staff Management
10. Business Intelligence and Analytics

