# PART 26 — ACCEPTANCE TESTS

The system is not complete until these workflows pass.

TEST 1: Product Creation
Create a shoe product with multiple sizes and colours, unique SKUs and barcodes.

TEST 2: Purchase
Create a supplier purchase order, receive products and verify inventory increases correctly.

TEST 3: POS Billing
Scan a barcode, create an invoice, apply a discount, calculate GST and accept payment.

TEST 4: Inventory Deduction
Verify the exact sold variant's stock decreases after successful billing.

TEST 5: Sales Return
Return an item and verify refund, customer ledger and stock movement.

TEST 6: Exchange
Exchange a size 8 shoe for a size 9 shoe and verify both stock movements.

TEST 7: Credit Sale
Create a customer credit sale and verify outstanding balance.

TEST 8: Supplier Payment
Record a supplier payment and verify the supplier ledger.

TEST 9: Online Order
Create an online order and reserve inventory.

TEST 10: Shared Inventory
Sell the same variant online and in-store under concurrent conditions and verify that overselling is prevented.

TEST 11: Permissions
Verify accountant access cannot perform unauthorized owner-only actions.

TEST 12: Reports
Verify dashboard sales, inventory and financial reports match underlying database transactions.

TEST 13: Printing
Print test invoices on 58mm, 80mm and A4 formats.

TEST 14: Language
Verify that English and Hindi interfaces work across all major modules.

TEST 15: Backup
Verify that backups can be created and a documented restoration procedure works.

